WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.440
- We've got this 84-inch roller

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:05.080
and 100 two-liter bottles of soda.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.997
Let's see what happens.

00:00:07.021 --> 00:00:08.861
So we went to Costco to get all these.

00:00:08.861 --> 00:00:11.608
We pretty much emptied out
their entire Coke collection,

00:00:11.608 --> 00:00:13.108
just for you guys.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.072
Don't feel bad for the wasted soda.

00:00:15.072 --> 00:00:17.632
You shouldn't be drinking
that stuff anyway, kids, okay?

00:00:17.632 --> 00:00:18.965
This is awesome.

00:00:19.004 --> 00:00:21.101
What I want to see is
just pure explosions.

00:00:21.101 --> 00:00:23.000
We've got Jarrod here shaking up bottles.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.941
That's the next move.
We've got 'em all laid out.

00:00:24.941 --> 00:00:27.440
We're gonna start shaking
'em and get crazy.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:28.607
- [Both] Ehhh!

00:00:29.531 --> 00:00:32.311
(all shout and laugh)

00:00:32.311 --> 00:00:33.144
- Let's do this.

00:00:33.144 --> 00:00:35.561
(explosions)

00:00:36.345 --> 00:00:38.428
(laughs)

00:00:39.162 --> 00:00:39.995
Yeah!

00:00:40.265 --> 00:00:41.290
(bottles pop)

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:42.123
Yeah!

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:47.390
(electro music and bottles
fizzing loudly as they explode)

00:00:48.619 --> 00:00:49.452
Oh man!

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:55.060
This is awesome! (laughs)

00:00:55.091 --> 00:00:56.591
Oh oh oh oh oh oh!

00:00:57.984 --> 00:01:01.651
(loud music as bottles pop)

00:01:03.322 --> 00:01:05.905
Ooh. Ooh. Ooh, that is awesome.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.340
Look at the chaos!

00:01:08.451 --> 00:01:09.851
That's beautiful.

00:01:09.851 --> 00:01:12.601
(pounding music)

00:01:13.319 --> 00:01:15.032
Look at the carnage, we've got bottles

00:01:15.032 --> 00:01:17.270
all the way over there in the corner.

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:18.731
Bottle caps were flying off.

00:01:18.731 --> 00:01:21.141
It sounded like fireworks
for a second, it was awesome.

00:01:21.141 --> 00:01:22.392
That was so much fun.

00:01:22.392 --> 00:01:24.371
Why is exploding things so much fun?

00:01:24.371 --> 00:01:26.771
I don't know, I'm not
searching for a deeper answer,

00:01:26.771 --> 00:01:27.931
I just want to see more.

00:01:27.931 --> 00:01:29.461
We should explode some more stuff, right?

00:01:29.461 --> 00:01:32.211
(pounding music)

